  "body": "There are various parts of this spec that attempt to define what the \"map entries\" are for maplikes in terms of a Map.  But maplikes already have a Map whose [[MapData]] is defined to be the \"map entries\".  See https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-maplike\r\n\r\nSo whatever you're doing with `[[data]]` right now should instead be done by manipulating the `[[BackingMap]]`, I would think.  And you need to specify exactly how you manipulate it, of course.",
